Phase 1 (Tier 1 — Keyword Search): 

POST   /api/v1/skills-search 
   Body: SearchRequestDto (Section 5.1 parameters only) 
   Response: EmployeeSearchResultDto[] 
   Note: free_text and semantic_sources fields ignored until Phase 2. 

Phase 2 (Tier 2 — adds to existing endpoint + new admin endpoints): 

POST   /api/v1/skills-search 
   Body: SearchRequestDto (full — Section 5.1 + 5.2) 
   Response: EmployeeSearchResultDto[]   (same shape, richer ranking) 
 
PUT    /api/v1/admin/skills-search/employees/:id 
   Trigger full re-index of one employee (CV + experience + training + task). 
   Called when multiple fields change at once or manual refresh needed. 
   Response: 202 Accepted 
 
DELETE /api/v1/admin/skills-search/employees/:id 
   Remove all skills_search_index rows for this employee. 
   Called on hard delete or deactivation (soft delete). 
   Note: hard deletes are also handled automatically by ON DELETE CASCADE. 
   Response: 204 No Content 

Access control: Admin-only (confirm with stakeholder before implementing guard). 

