    Hybrid search (skills + free_text) → verify combined score ranking 

    Update an experience → verify index updates within seconds → re-query 

    Delete an employee → verify rows removed from skills_search_index 

    Shut down embedding service → save an experience → verify save succeeds, error is logged, stale index persists → /index/rebuild → verify updated 